        "texto": "Standing, as well as kneeling, was, among the Jews, an ancient posture during prayer. There are several other Scripture references to it besides the text. See 1 Sam 1:26; 1 Kings 8:22; 2 Chronicles 6:13; Luke 18:11,13. While in this attitude the hands were sometimes stretched out…"
